  "name": "UK STATS19 Road Safety Data 2023",
  "description": "Official UK road traffic collision data for the year 2023, collected under the STATS19 reporting framework by police forces across Great Britain. The dataset covers three linked tables: collision-level records (circumstances, location, severity), vehicle-level records (vehicle and driver characteristics), and casualty-level records (injuries sustained). Used as input for a machine-learning experiment predicting road crash severity (Slight / Serious / Fatal).",
  "url": "https://www.data.gov.uk/dataset/cb7ae6f0-4be6-4935-9277-47e5ce24a11f/road-safety-data",
  "dct:license": "https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/",
  "license": "https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/",
